#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1461 expect=violation domain=MH
#note "MHBDSYCD column absent while MHBODSYS is populated on two records -> fires ONCE for the dataset (Sensitivity: Dataset), never once per populated record. Two populated rows make the count discriminating: a record-level reading would report 2. The first row is the one PMDA-SD1461-skipped_bdsycd_column_absent-MH carries."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset MH
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col MHSEQ    type=Num
col MHBODSYS type=Char
---
S1 | MH | 001 | 1 | INFECTIONS
S1 | MH | 001 | 2 | Respiratory, thoracic and mediastinal disorders
---
